# Pinned agent-CLI versions — the single source of truth for the fast-changing tooling that the
# `assemble` build and the `update-tools` operation read/write (docs/runbook.md → "Updating agent
# tools"). Bump a line and run update-tools to build+verify+activate a new golden image in ~a minute,
# without rebuilding the heavy base. (Base tooling — node/gh/go/golangci/ruff/vscode — lives in
# build.sh and changes rarely.)
CLAUDE_CODE_VERSION=2.1.220
# Pin exact versions — never "latest". An unpinned tool auto-ingests a newly-published (possibly
# compromised) build with no operator review; every bump should be a reviewed, reproducible change.
CODEX_VERSION=0.147.0
